<%#
  Locals: icon (:book | :award | :graduation_cap | :podium | :document | :heart), value, label

  Card-framed variant of components/stat -- an icon badge above the number,
  for a section that's meant to read as a small set of headline figures
  (आमचा परिणाम) rather than a plain data row (the admin dashboard and
  styleguide keep the bare components/stat for that reason -- this is a
  homepage-specific dressing-up, not a replacement).

  Icon stays brand-700 monochrome, same rule as home/_activity_icon:
  docs/02-design-system.md's "one accent per screen" already spent on this
  page's donate CTA, so the icon badge doesn't introduce a second one.
%>
<div class="card flex flex-col items-center gap-3 p-8 text-center">
  <span class="flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-100 text-brand-700">
    <%= render "home/activity_icon", icon: icon %>
  </span>
  <span class="stat-value"><%= value %></span>
  <span class="stat-label"><%= label %></span>
</div>
